    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73238.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 151,
    "turn_text": "OK. Let's not throw up our hands when it's time to roll up our sleeves. Not now, not tomorrow, not ever. Years from now, our children and our grandchildren will look at us, each of us, and they will lock their eyes with ours. And they will ask us a question. And that question will be, where were you at that inflection moment? And what I know all of us will respond is we will say we were all here together, and we will tell them what we did at this moment. We will tell them the action we took. We won't simply tell them how we felt. We will tell them what we did, and we will be proud to do that.",
